---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Government Fellowships">
  <div class="py-8">
    <div class="mb-6 space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-6xl tracking-tight">Government Fellowships</h1>
      <h2 class="text-lg md:text-3xl font-light text-gray-700">
        Connecting technology professionals with government to improve public services
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 lg:gap-12 xl:gap-16">
      <div class="flex-grow max-w-5xl">
        <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <p>
                Our Fellowship program brings together developers, designers, and
                researchers on the same platform as domain experts and government entities.
                This collaboration helps improve government processes, accelerate digital
                transformation, and enhance citizen service delivery by leveraging
                technology, human-centered design processes, and collaboration.
              </p>
              <p>
                Each year, we select a limited number of technology professionals, pair
                them with government departments, and provide them training and skill
                upgrades, to work on public services. We offer mentorship from industry
                experts and exposure to inner workings of the government. Most
                importantly, the fellows work on government projects that create a
                large-scale positive impact.
              </p>
              <p>
                The objective of each Fellowship is to develop innovative, citizen-centered
                digital solutions that are both sustainable and cost-effective for our
                government partners. These solutions are crafted using open-source
                technologies, with the potential to be replicated and redeployed in
                departments and cities with similar contexts and use cases.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <img
                src="https://codeforpakistan.org/sites/default/files/inline-images/fellowships.jpg"
                alt="Problem statement workshop"
                class="w-full rounded"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="heading pt-4">Key Features</h3>
          <p>Our Fellowship Program revolves around three key features:</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <article class="bg-gray-50 rounded overflow-hidden">
              <img
                src="https://codeforpakistan.org/sites/default/files/inline-images/ff_01.jpg"
                alt="Citizens and government collaboration"
                class="w-full h-40 object-cover"
              />
              <div class="p-4">
                <p>Citizens and government working together, hand-in-hand, to solve problems</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="bg-gray-50 rounded overflow-hidden">
              <img
                src="https://codeforpakistan.org/sites/default/files/inline-images/ff_02.jpg"
                alt="User-centric development"
                class="w-full h-40 object-cover"
              />
              <div class="p-4">
                <p>Adopting user-centric, lean, and agile development methodologies</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            <article class="bg-gray-50 rounded overflow-hidden">
              <img
                src="https://codeforpakistan.org/sites/default/files/inline-images/ff_03.jpg"
                alt="Civic engagement through innovation"
                class="w-full h-40 object-cover"
              />
              <div class="p-4">
                <p>Increasing civic engagement by creating innovative solutions in public services</p>
              </div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <h3 class="heading pt-4">How it works</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-8 textcenter">
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <p class="text-sm"><strong>Discovery Research:</strong> We sit with government departments to discuss and identify areas of improvement.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <p class="text-sm"><strong>Cohort Selection:</strong> Government hires skilled technologists and designers to work on digital solutions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <p class="text-sm"><strong>Agile Development:</strong> Fellows collaborate with departments to iteratively build the required applications.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <p class="text-sm"><strong>Deploy &amp; Train:</strong> Software is tested and deployed, stakeholders are trained on using and maintaining the solution.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
              <p class="text-sm"><strong>Scale &amp; Iterate:</strong> Application usage is monitored, tracked, and adjusted for long term sustainability.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h3 class="heading pt-4">Our Impact in Numbers</h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">75</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Solutions Developed</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">212</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Fellows Graduated</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">600</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Government Employees Trained</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white border rounded p-4">
              <p class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-none">2.1M</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Community Members Served</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>


